:: StoryTitle
The Strength of the Earth

:: StoryData
{
  "id": "radici-dimenticate",
  "author": "Specula Elementae",
  "startPassage": "prologo"
}

:: prologo [opening]
A tiny plant sprouts from the ground. Nature grows all around you: watch it change and learn to know it step by step.

[[Follow the growth->inizio-avventura]]

:: inizio-avventura
The earth moves with calm and steady strength. Every turn of the game changes like a season of the year: observe carefully before you play your card.

:: evento-round-2 [mid-story]
A strong root rises from the ground to help you. The earth gives you its energy: the next card you play will be even stronger.

```gameEffects
{
  "nextCardPowerBonus": 1,
  "roundSpecific": 2
}
```

:: epilogo-vittoria [ending victory]
Your strategy worked. The plants you cared for have grown strong and safe, and the forest is now protected thanks to you.

:: epilogo-sconfitta [ending defeat]
A seed needs time underground before it becomes a great tree. Look at your cards, gather your strength, and play another game.
